  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building for the Green Industry Platform in China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China is in the phase of fast industrial development, but the dual pressures of resources and energy constraints and serious ecological damage have taken a heavy toll on the current industrial development and the national economic sustainable development. On the one hand, High energy-consuming industrial enterprises drive the economic growth, on the other hand they become a major source of energy consumption and environmental pollution. Adjustment of domestic industrial economic structure, changing the way of industrial development, and finding a path of sustainable growth in the industrial development have become the top priorities in China. The Chinese government has put the ecological civilization up to an unprecedented strategic level and into the five-in-one national development goal. The Chinese government demands acceleration of the establishment of a completely systematically ecological civilization system. Meanwhile, in #the Thirteenth Five-Year Plan for National Economic and Social development#, the Chinese government made specific requirements on energy conservation and achieving green, low-carbon and environmentally friendly development in the industrial sector, in order to comprehensively improve environmental awareness and resource efficiency in the industrial sector, and to promote the green indu</narrative>
  </description>
